      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would make VrChat so unwelcoming to a new player. A player would have to play for weeks or so in the lonely lower public lobbies just to get to play where everyone else is, and that is if they were informed about linking their account to that point. Linking your account is a whole issue in its self, there is so many people that don't know how, don't want to take the time to, or flat out don't even know that there is a reason there are 4 characters at the end of their name. There is the info out there on how to do it and it doesn't take that long but it can be so easy to miss. Ranking up to new user would also be a tedious hurdle. You would have to play in an environment full of annoying children for long enough, and find enough people good enough to be friends with to rank up. I can't imagine many new players would ever make their way out of a hellscape like that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
